  "description": {
    "en": "Luxilon ALU Power Rough is the textured version of the iconic ALU Power polyester string. Its dented surface increases ball bite and spin while also allowing additional string flex, creating a slightly softer and more forgiving response than standard ALU Power. The 1.25 mm gauge emphasizes feel, spin and responsiveness, while the 1.30 mm version provides greater durability and stability. Roger Federer famously used ALU Power Rough in the crosses of a natural gut hybrid setup.",

    "zh": "Luxilon ALU Power Rough 是经典 ALU Power 的纹理版本。其凹凸表面能够增强球线与网球之间的咬合，从而提升旋转表现，同时表面结构也增加了一定的球线弯曲能力，因此相比标准 ALU Power 拥有略微更加柔和和宽容的击球反馈。1.25毫米版本更强调旋转、手感与响应速度；1.30毫米版本则更加注重耐久性、稳定性和方向控制。Roger Federer 曾长期将 ALU Power Rough 作为天然肠线混穿方案中的横线使用。"
  },

